 "strings": {
  "Hm? Sure.": "",
  "How long's it been like that?": "",
  "For how long?": "",
  "For about a month. Some drunk asshole\nchucked a rock, cracked it right open.": "",
  "A month or so. Some drunk asshole\nchucked a rock at it.": "",
  "It was just for show, though.\nNever actually worked in the first place.": "",
  "Though it never actually worked\nin the first place.": "",
  "Not much use to me then...": "",
  "Huh, all right then.": "",
  "Did you just sit and watch while\nthe Matsugane tore into Kume?": "",
  "While they were beating Kume,\nwhat were you doing?": "",
  "Whaddya mean?\nWhat else could I have done?": "",
  "Whaddya mean?\nWhat could I have done?": "",
  "Called the cops on them, for one.\nNot like they're especially good for business.": "",
  "You could probably have called the cops\non them, for one.": "",
  "Nor is a dead body in your club.": "",
  "A death in the club can't be\ngood for business.": "",
  "Come on, they'd have killed me if I did that.": "",
  "The cops? You're kidding.\nThe family would kill me.": "",
  "And frankly, it didn't look like\nthey were hurting him too bad.": "",
  "Besides, I didn't think they'd kill him.\nThey weren't hurting him that bad.": "",
  "If anything they were going easy on him.": "",
  "Kinda going easy on him, really.": "",
  "Meaning what?": "",
  "How's that?": "",
  "Like, just smacking him around a bit.\nNothing too serious.": "",
  "Just smacking him around a bit.\nNothing too serious.": "",
  "Once in a while they'd hit him a little harder.\nTo make him bleed I guess.": "",
  "Once in a while they'd draw some blood...\nBut still, not too bad.": "",
  "The cops came by after the incident, right?": "",
  "The cops came by\nafter the incident, right?": "",
  "A detective, yeah. Guy named Kuroiwa,\napparently with Organized Crime.": "",
  "Yeah, a detective.\nSaid his name was Kuroiwa.": "",
  "What did you tell him?": "",
  "Not a whole lot.\nSame stuff I told you.": "",
  "Not much. Same stuff I've been\ntelling you.": "",
  "Forensics was tearing this place apart.": "",
  "Trying to find blood stains from Kume.\nY'know, with that luminol stuff.": "",
  "Trying to find blood stains from the victim.\nY'know, with that luminol stuff.": "",
  "I thought I'd wiped all that up before\nthey got here, but that sure was a waste...": "",
  "By the time they got here,\nI thought I'd cleaned it all up...": "",
  "Turns out blood's tougher\nto clean up than I thought.": "",
  "But turns out, it's tougher to clean\nthan I thought.": "",
  "Now they're convinced\nthe murder happened here.": "",
  "Now they're convinced the murder\nhappened here, and I can't argue.": "",
  "Was there that much blood?\nBefore you wiped it up, I mean.": "",
  "Was there much blood?\nBefore you wiped it up, I mean.": "",
  "No, not really. I told you,\nthey barely even made Kume bleed.": "",
  "Nah, not really.\nLike I said, they held back.": "",
  "Sounds like he didn't die here, then.": "",
  "Well I certainly wouldn't know.": "",
  "Yeah, I could've told you that.": "",
  "Well, thanks.\nThis is a huge help.": "",
  "Well, thanks. This is a huge help.": "",
  "We done here?": "",
  "Kaito. What's up?": "",
  "Hey man. Where are you?": "",
  "It's Kaito. Where are you?": "",
  "Just left a club called Amour.\nOver on Suppon Street.": "",
  "Amour?\nIsn't that one of the Matsugane joints?": "",
  "Amour...? Ain't that one of\nthe Matsugane joints?": "",
  "Yup. Hamura and the victim were apparently\nalone in here the night of the murder.": "",
  "Anyway, need something?": "",
  "Yup. Swing by the office\nwhen you're done there.": "",
  "Yup. When you're done over there,\nhead back to the office.": "",
  "Everything okay?": "",
  "Ehh, it's no rush.\nYou'll see when you get here. Later.": "",
  "Yeah, it's no rush.\nYou'll see when you get here. Later.": "",
  "Mind if I pick your brain again?": "",
  "Go right ahead, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Yagami-san? Sure, what is it?": "",
  "I'm here on business.\nThat should be obvious.": "",
  "Business?": "",
  "The prosecutor's office is pressing murder charges\nagainst Kyohei Hamura of the Matsugane Family.": "",
  "You're involved, aren't you, Yagami-kun?": "",
  "Yagami-kun, you're involved in this too?": "",
  "Word travels fast.": "",
  "Nothing that happens in Genda's office\ngets away from me.": "",
  "Saori-san just can't keep a secret, huh? ": "",
  "You heard it from Saori-san, I'm guessing.\nShe just can't keep a secret, huh? ": "",
  "Not with me!\nWe go way back.": "",
  "Not with me.\nYou know we're old friends.": "",
  "Since you were kids, right?": "",
  "Same college too, right?": "",
  "Back to Hamura, though... they're already\npressing charges? They only just arrested him.": "",
  "So they're pressing charges against Hamura?\nThey only just arrested him.": "",
  "Apparently the prosecutor's had his eye on Hamura for a while now.\nHe's just been lying in wait for the perfect moment to strike.": "",
  "Apparently, the prosecutor's had his eye on Hamura.\nHe's been waiting, and this was his chance to strike.": "",
  "And this prosecutor is...?": "",
  "Your friend, Izumida.": "",
  "Prosecutor Izumida.": "",
  "Somehow I knew it'd be him.": "",
  "You haven't seen that guy since the\nwhole not guilty verdict, huh, Tak?": "",
  "Izumida, huh...? Haven't seen him since\nyour big win, Tak.": "",
  "He's probably still sore about it.": "",
  "Facing off, just like three years ago...": "",
  "Too bad Shintani's gonna be the one\nin charge of the case and not me.": "",
  "No, we're not. I'm not facing off with anybody.\nThis is Shintani's case.": "",
  "...You're really never becoming\na lawyer again, are you?": "",
  "So it's true?\nYou'll never be a lawyer again?": "",
  "I don't wanna talk about it anymore.\nGenda-sensei asked me the same question.": "",
  "Genda-sensei asked me the same question.\nI'm done talking about it.": "",
  "Does the prosecution have any work for me?\nI'd be glad to cut you a discount.": "",
  "Does the prosecution have any work for me?\nI'll cut you a discount, Mafuyu.": "",
  "You know what, Yagami-kun?": "",
  "If you want my opinion...": "",
  "This detective business\nreally doesn't suit you.": "",
  "Yagami-kun... This detective business\nreally doesn't suit you.": "",
  "Couldn't she have just called?": "",
  "Think she went through the\ntrouble for a reason? Maybe you?": "",
  "She came all this way to drop in.\nWonder why.": "",
  "It's getting dark out.\nI should walk her back.": "",
  "...You know, it's getting dark out.\nI should walk her back.": "",
  "(Where'd she go?)": "",
  "(I have to find Mafuyu.)": "",
  "So you're defending Hamura, huh?": "",
  "Nope, Shintani's handling it.\nI'm just collecting evidence.": "",
  "Looks like you don't need\nthat walk home, Mafuyu. Later.": "",
  "...Looks like you don't need\nthat walk home. Later.": "",
  "Oh yeah, I almost forgot.\nYou're not a lawyer anymore.": "",
  "Ah, of course. You're not\na lawyer anymore.": "",
  "Even after your landmark acquittal.\nToo bad.": "",
  "Even after your landmark acquittal.\nWhat a shame.": "",
  "I only won because I was up against you.": "",
  "It wasn't that big. I only won because\nI was up against you.": "",
  "You shut your damn mouth.": "",
  "If it wasn't for your bullshit logic, that murderer would've\nbeen behind bars. An innocent girl died because of you!": "",
  "Your bullshit logic put a murderer on the streets.\nAn innocent girl died because of you!": "",
  "Tell me what was so \"bullshit\" about my defense,\nthen. Come on, say it.": "",
  "Hm? What was \"bullshit\" about it?\nGive me an opening statement here, Prosecutor.": "",
  "Everything!": "",
  "That's enough, Izumida.": "",
  "It's okay, Izumida-san.": "",
  "Stop it, Izumida-san.": "",
  "Thanks for thinking of me, Yagami-kun.": "",
  "Thanks for thinking of me.": "",
  "Excuse us.": "",
  "Man, has that guy got an aura or what?\nIf I was a chick I'd be way into that.": "",
  "Who was that old fox? He had style.\nIf I was a chick, I'd be all over that.": "",
  "Not now, Kaito-san.": "",
  "Can you not?": "",
  "My bad, my bad.": "",
  "...Ah, right. Never mind.": "",
  "So? What do we do?\nAbout the case.": "",
  "Mafuyu said they're already\npressing charges.": "",
  "We should go to Genda's. Let Shintani know\nwhat's going on. I want you there, too.": "",
  "I should go to Genda's. Let Shintani know\nwhat's going on. Kaito-san, you come too.": "",
  "Got it.\nSee you over there, then.": "",
  "Got it. I'll go on ahead, then.": "",
  "What is it now?": "",
  "Huh? Why?": "",
  "Look, just, uh, take a breather, huh?\nCount to ten or something.": "",
  "Look, just... Take a breather, okay?\nTry to calm down.": "",
  "I'll give you a breather...": "",
  "I didn't ask for advice.": "",
  "Hey, Yagami. The hell were you thinking sending Kaito\nhere by himself? Guy acts like he owns the goddamn place.": "",
  "Hey, Yagami! The hell were you thinking sending Kaito here\nby himself? Guy's acting like he owns the goddamn place.": "",
  "Ha, all hail King Kaito.": "",
  "Huh, I never noticed.": "",
  "Just sit your ass down, would you?": "",
  "Oh, come on... Just sit down.": "",
  "So, we finally have some details from the cops.": "",
  "So, we finally have some details\nfrom the cops.": "",
  "Murder specifics, forensic results... \nEven their \"proof\" that Hamura's the one who did it.": "",
  "Murder specifics, forensic results...\nBest of all, their \"proof\" that Hamura's the one who did it.": "",
  "That's a lot.": "",
  "Good stuff.": "",
  "Let's see it.": "",
  "Let's see.": "",
  "But first...": "",
  "Just, don't forget your role in all of this.\nEspecially you, Yagami.": "",
  "Just, don't forget your role in all this.\nEspecially Yagami.": "",
  "At the end of the day, you're just a mercenary. The one who\ndecides how this investigation goes... is me. Understand?": "",
  "At the end of the day, you're just a freelancer.\nI'm the one actually running this investigation. Understand?": "",
  "You got it.\nIt's your show.": "",
  "Yup, got it. You're the boss.": "",
  "Now why don't we look at\nthose documents, Shintani-sensei?": "",
  "Now why don't we look at those documents...\n Shintani-<font_kind=yakuza_italic>sensei</font_kind>?": "",
  "That's more like it.\nFirst up is the crime scene.": "",
  "That's more like it.\nNow, first up is the crime scene.": "",
  "Just got the call from Mafuyu-kun.": "",
  "Mafuyu-kun just gave me a call.": "",
  "Sounds like they're seriously gearing up\nfor this trial. You and Shintani better be ready.": "",
  "Sounds like they're seriously gearing up for this trial.\nYou and Shintani better be ready.": "",
  "Around 6 AM, morning of December 4th. Police get\na call about a body in the alleyway behind Amour.": "",
  "Around 6 AM, morning of December 4th.\nSomeone calls in a body in the alleyway behind Amour.": "",
  "The officer who rushed to the scene\nconfirmed the corpse on arrival.": "",
  "The officer who rushed to the scene at Amour\nconfirmed the corpse on arrival.": "",
  "Victim was a Kansai thug, bottom feeder\nwith the Kyorei Clan. Toshiro Kume.": "",
  "Victim was a Kansai thug with the Kyorei Clan.\nToshiro Kume. Just a bottom feeder in the family.": "",
  "Body had a few bruises, but the cause of death is pretty\nobvious. Two puncture wounds, straight through the eyes.": "",
  "The body had a few noticeable bruises, but the actual\ncause of death... Two puncture wounds straight through the eyes.": "",
  "The cops think the murderer used something\nlike an ice pick, pierced right into his brain.": "",
  "The impact and depth of the wounds suggest\nit was done with something like an ice pick.": "",
  "My eyes hurt just thinking about it.": "",
  "...My eyes hurt just thinking about it.": "",
  "The cause of death was severe brain trauma, directly through\nthe eye sockets. Weapon must've been long and pointed, like an ice pick.": "",
  "The cause of death was severe brain trauma through the eye sockets.\nWeapon must've been long and pointed, like an ice pick.": "",
  "Looks like the murder weapon went through Kume's eyes,\nthen tore 'em out when the killer took it back.": "",
  "Only natural to think the Tojo was trying to make\nan example out of him. You know, threaten the Kyorei.": "",
  "It'd be easy to think the Tojo wanted to scare off the Kyorei,\nand get them to back out of Kamurocho.": "",
  "So, even if Hamura didn't do it,\nit's damn likely that someone from the Tojo Clan did.": "",
  "So, even if Hamura isn't the actual murderer here,\nit's damn likely <font_kind=yakuza_italic>someone</font_kind> from the Tojo Clan is.": "",
  "And if we can figure out who it was,\nHamura'll be off the hook.": "",
  "What, find the real killer?\nThat's a step too far.": "",
  "What, find the real killer?\nWe don't need to go that far.": "",
  "Priority number one is proving his alibi.\nWe do that, we're in the clear.": "",
  "Priority number one is proving his alibi.\nWe do that, and everybody's in the clear.": "",
  "Did they gouge his eyes out to make an example\nout of him? Or was it something else...?": "",
  "Did they gouge his eyes out to make an example of him?\nOr something else...?": "",
  "Night of the crime, an employee from another bar\ntossed their trash out in this alley. 'Round 2 AM.": "",
  "Night of the crime, an employee from another bar\ntossed their trash out 'round 2 AM.": "",
  "Didn't see anything out\nof the ordinary, though.": "",
  "In other words, Kume got dumped sometime\nbetween 2 and 6 AM, when the body was found.": "",
  "In other words, Kume got dumped sometime between...\n2 and 6 AM, when the body was found.": "",
  "The body wasn't here at 2 AM when someone\nfrom another bar took the trash out.": "",
  "The body wasn't here at 2 AM when\nsomeone from another bar took the trash out.": "",
  "It must've been dumped after that,\nbut before 6 when it was found.": "",
  "There was pretty much no\nblood anywhere near the body.": "",
  "As far as the investigators could find,\nthere was barely any blood around the body.": "",
  "Meaning Kume wasn't murdered in that alley.": "",
  "Which means... wherever the guy died,\nit probably wasn't in the alley.": "",
  "If I had to guess,\nI'd say he died in Amour.": "",
  "I'd guess he died in Amour.": "",
  "There's not even a drop of blood\nnear the body.": "",
  "It's highly likely Kume\nwas killed somewhere else.": "",
  "That tells us one thing: it's highly likely\nKume was killed somewhere else.": "",
  "Nothing was found in Kume's pockets.\nNo wallet, no phone, nothing.": "",
  "Bet the murderer broke the phone. The cops tried one\nof those \"find my phone\" things, but came up empty-handed.": "",
  "Bet the murderer broke the phone.\nThe cops tried a GPS search on it, but no dice.": "",
  "Guess the killer at least tried to cover his tracks.": "",
  "I mean, not like the killer was subtle,\nbut he <font_kind=yakuza_italic>tried</font_kind> to cover his tracks.": "",
  "No clue where Kume's phone and wallet are now.\nThey're not on the body, that's for sure.": "",
  "(I'll have to figure out the cause of death first.\nNo matter how you look at it, this here must be it...)": "",
  "(The cause of death was severe brain trauma, directly through the eye sockets.\nWeapon must've been long and pointed, like an ice pick.)": "",
  "(Did they gouge his eyes out to make an example\nout of him? Or was it something else...?)": "",
  "(Something's not right. If this is where the\nmurder happened, where's the blood?)": "",
  "(There's not even a drop of blood\nnear the body.)": "",
  "(It's highly likely Kume\nwas killed somewhere else.)": "",
  "(Next I need to figure out how they disposed of\nthe corpse. Is there anything that would point to that?)": "",
  "(The body wasn't here at 2 AM when someone\nfrom another bar took the trash out.)": "",
  "(In other words, Kume got dumped sometime between\n2 and 6 AM, when the body was found.)": "",
  "(Come to think of it, what happened to the victim's\npossessions, like a wallet or a cellphone...?)": "",
  "(Nothing was found in Kume's pockets.\nNo wallet, no phone, nothing.)": "",
  "You take a peek in the alley\nwhen you were over at Amour?": "",
  "You dropped by Amour, right?\nDid you take a peek in the alley?": "",
  "Doubt there's any traces left at this point,\nbut it's apparently just out the back.": "",
  "Doubt there's even a trace left at this point,\nbut it's apparently just out the back.": "",
  "Anyway.": "",
  "Well, anyway.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Meaning what?": "หมายความว่าไง?",
  "How's that?": "หมายความว่ายังไง?",
  "You shut your damn mouth.": "หุบปากไปเลย",
  "What is it now?": "มีอะไรอีกล่ะ?",
  "Huh? Why?": "หา? ทำไมล่ะ?",
  "Good stuff.": "ของดีนี่",
  "Let's see.": "ขอดูหน่อย"
 }
}
